1. Our own code (humanfia)
--------------------------

Our multi-agent proof-tree system LOT wrote the proof in tree g-oai-074
(2026-10-21 01:44Z to 2026-10-22 20:36Z). The sections below cover the parts that
were not written in that tree.

- proof/Submission.lean
- proof/Submission/Obl/ (7,231 files): one directory per obligation of the tree
- proof/Submission/Lib/ (519 files): the tree's shared library
- proof/Submission/Seed/K4/Basic.lean: our seed for this problem
- proof/PROBLEM.md: LOT's task text
- proof/lakefile.toml, proof/lake-manifest.json and proof/lean-toolchain: our
  toolchain and library pins

Many files in Obl/ and Lib/ carry comments such as "Adapted from this LOT tree,
o151, session x0508, commit ...". These name sessions, branches and commits of the
same tree g-oai-074, so they are internal provenance, not third-party code.


