7. Mathematics
--------------

- Theorem: OpenAI, "Every four-dimensional Kakeya set has full Hausdorff dimension",
  OpenAI mathematics release, paper family 074, September 24, 2026,
  https://github.com/openai/math (preprints/Every-four-dimensional-Kakeya-set-has-full-Hausdorff-dimension-September-24-2026).
- The proof follows the paper. The results the paper cites, and the arguments it
  follows, are due to:
  - Wang and Zahl;
  - Guth, Wang and Zahl;
  - Carbery and Valdimarsson;
  - Orponen, de Saxcé and Shmerkin;
  - Sudakov, Szemerédi and Vu.
  All of them are proved in Lean here, either directly or through the WangZahlLot
  library.


